FixPlan.unverified and FixPlan.certification_skips hold the drift phase's fail-closed counts (Unknown outcomes and Drift/Uncertified skips). check::run must gate its non-zero exit on these counts at both the dry-run and apply sites, or an unresolved Unknown move would silently exit 0 and slip past pre-commit/CI. The usize fields can be ignored without any compiler error, so they must be wired into both exit gates by name — an unwired count field compiles silently.
